@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #243247
skinparam objectBackgroundColor #E3F3EF
skinparam objectBorderColor #60758A
skinparam ArrowColor #53657A
left to right direction
title TripBook snapshots across two deletions
object "before: TripBook" as Before {
  names = [Japan, Korea]
  selected = 1
}
object "afterFirstDelete: TripBook" as First {
  names = [Korea]
  selected = 0
}
object "afterSecondDelete: TripBook" as Second {
  names = []
  selected = -1
}
Before ..> First : trip delete 1
First ..> Second : trip delete 1
note bottom of Before : Korea is selected.
note bottom of First : Korea remains selected.
note bottom of Second : No trip is selected.\nExpenses are unchanged.
legend bottom
  Snapshots of the same object at different times.
  Dashed arrows show progression, not UML associations.
  Internal selected indexes are zero-based; CLI indexes are one-based.
endlegend
@enduml
